------------------------------
BACH uses SQLite (`bach.db`) as primary data storage (currently 210+ tables).
JSON files are ONLY permitted in justified exceptional cases.

WHEN DATABASE (STANDARD)?
--------------------------
  - Persistent system data (tools, tasks, config)
