FILES
================================================================================

Source files:
  hub/mem.py handler definition
  tools/memory_working_cleanup.py Working memory cleanup implementation
  tools/memory_decay.py Memory Decay Implementation

Database:
  data/bach.db SQLite3 with memory tables

