    |   +-- TAX_README.txt
    |   +-- FINANZAMT.bat
    |   +-- SYNC.bat
    +-- Extraordinary loads/
    +-- Household-related services & craftsmen/
    +-- Special editions/
    +-- Insurance and pension provision/

CLI COMMANDS
-----------

STATUS & OVERVIEW:
  bach steuer status              Show overall status
  bach steuer status --jahr 2025  Status for a year

TAXY YEAR:
